3c:T83a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is VIP transportation in Riyadh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"VIP transportation is chauffeur-driven luxury transport coordinated around an itinerary — airport meet & greet, hotel and venue transfers, standby, and multi-vehicle movement — using vehicles such as the Mercedes-Maybach, S-Class, Range Rover, and Lexus. It is arrival logistics, not just a single ride."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which vehicles do you use for VIP transportation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For Riyadh VIP movement we arrange the Mercedes-Maybach S-Class, Range Rover Autobiography, and Lexus LX 600, plus the Mercedes S-Class, Cadillac Escalade, and GMC Yukon for larger parties — all with professional chauffeurs, subject to availability."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you handle event and delegation transport with multiple vehicles?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We coordinate multi-vehicle movement with synchronised routes and a dedicated coordinator for corporate events, conferences, exhibitions, weddings, and government delegations across Riyadh."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer VIP airport transfers at King Khalid International (RUH)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We provide flight monitoring and meet & greet at RUH, then a chauffeured transfer to your hotel, residence, office, or venue in Riyadh."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book by the hour, half-day, or full-day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer hourly charter, half-day, full-day, and multi-day standby so a chauffeur and vehicle stay dedicated to your schedule throughout."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does VIP transportation cost in Riyadh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing depends on the vehicle, hours, standby, number of vehicles, and itinerary, so we provide a tailored quote rather than fixed online pricing — no hidden fees and no surge. Send your plan on WhatsApp for a clear quote."}}]}28:[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3c"}}]]
